      "japanese": "子どもじゃないんだから、と自分でも呆れてしまうが、それでも8時間以上寝ている。",
      "english_translation": "\"I'm even frustrated with myself for not being a child, but I still sleep for over 8 hours.\""
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "休みの日、朝早く起きなくてもいい日は幸せだ。",
      "english_translation": "It's a happy day when you don't have to wake up early on your days off."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "いつもより遅い時間まで寝て、気持ちよく起きる。",
      "english_translation": "I usually sleep later than usual and wake up feeling refreshed."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "japanese": "反対に、平日はまだ起きたくない時間にだいたい目覚まし時計が鳴る。",
      "english_translation": "Conversely, the alarm clock usually rings at times when I'm still asleep during weekdays."
    }
